      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,500;600&display=swap');\n.lesson-page{--canvas:#f0f4f4;--surface:#fbfcfb;--surface-2:#e4ecee;--ink:#162d3b;--muted:#536975;--rule:#c7d3d5;--brand:#173d50;--brand-deep:#102f40;--accent:#c97039;--accent-soft:#efbd78;--good:#236b50;--serif:'Source Serif 4',Georgia,serif;--sans:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-family:var(--sans);background:var(--canvas);color:var(--ink)}\n.lesson-page a:focus-visible,.lesson-page button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}\n.top-shell{max-width:1220px;margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:34px}\n.lesson-stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.28fr 1fr;min-height:490px;background:var(--brand-deep);color:#f7f9f6}\n.stage-art{min-width:0;min-height:490px;background:#d9eeee}\n.stage-art img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:490px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center}\n.stage-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:52px clamp(34px,5vw,76px)}\n.lesson-unit-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:48px}\n.lesson-unit-list li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.indicator-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(19,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}\n.lesson-resources{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}\n.lesson-resource{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:24px 26px 24px 0}\n.lesson-resource+.lesson-resource{padding-left:26px;border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}\n@media(max-width:760px){.top-shell{padding-inline:18px}.lesson-stage{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:0}.stage-art{min-height:0;height:220px}.stage-art img{min-height:0;height:100%;object-position:center 48%}.stage-copy{padding:26px 24px 30px}.lesson-unit-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;column-gap:0}.lesson-unit-list li{padding:16px 0}.indicator-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.lesson-resources{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lesson-resource{padding:20px 0}.lesson-resource+.lesson-resource{padding-left:0;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.lesson-mobile-meta{display:flex}.lesson-desktop-meta{display:none}}\n@media(min-width:761px){.lesson-mobile-meta{display:none}}\n.lesson-page #presentation [aria-label=\"Presentation tools\"] button{min-height:44px}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.lesson-page[data-follow-system='true']{--canvas:#111d23;--surface:#192832;--surface-2:#223742;--ink:#e9f0f0;--muted:#acc0c5;--rule:#40535c;--brand:#102f40;--brand-deep:#0b2635;--accent:#efaa72;--accent-soft:#f1c489;--good:#87c6a0}}\n.lesson-page[data-theme='dark']{--canvas:#111d23;--surface:#192832;--surface-2:#223742;--ink:#e9f0f0;--muted:#acc0c5;--rule:#40535c;--brand:#102f40;--brand-deep:#0b2635;--accent:#efaa72;--accent-soft:#f1c489;--good:#87c6a0}\n.lesson-page .indicator-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(44px,1fr))}.lesson-page .indicator-grid button{width:44px;min-height:44px}\n</style>\n<div class=\"lesson-page min-h-screen m-0\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"lesson page container\" data-theme=\"light\">\n    <header class=\"border-b border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"header container\">\n        <div class=\"top-shell flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-between gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation wrapper\">\n            <a aria-label=\"ZeeTeach home\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 no-underline text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"home link\" href=\"#top\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[var(--brand)] text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo wrapper\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo text\">\n                        Z\n                    </span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[21px] font-semibold tracking-[-.04em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"site name text\">\n                    ZeeTeach\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-3 text-[14px] text-[var(--muted)] max-sm:hidden\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"breadcrumb navigation\">\n                <a class=\"no-underline hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"home link\" href=\"/\">\n                    Home\n                </a>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"breadcrumb separator\">\n                    /\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"breadcrumb class text\">\n                    Class XI\n                </span>\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"breadcrumb separator\">\n                    /\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"breadcrumb subject text\">\n                    Economics\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <button aria-label=\"Light theme selected\" class=\"flex min-h-[42px] shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--canvas)] px-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"theme toggle button\" type=\"button\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-[22px] w-[38px] items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface-2)] p-[2px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"theme icon container\">\n                    <span class=\"size-4 bg-[var(--surface)] shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"theme toggle handle\">\n                    </span>\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"theme label\">\n                    Light\n                </span>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Economics learning materials\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"navigation menu\">\n        <div class=\"top-shell flex min-h-[52px] items-stretch gap-9 max-sm:gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"navigation link wrapper\">\n            <a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"flex min-h-[52px] items-center border-b-[3px] border-[var(--accent)] px-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--brand)] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"presentation link\" href=\"#presentation\">\n                Presentation\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-[52px] items-center border-b-[3px] border-transparent px-1 text-[14px] text-[var(--muted)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"study guide link\" href=\"/study-guide\">\n                Study guide\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-[52px] items-center border-b-[3px] border-transparent px-1 text-[14px] text-[var(--muted)] no-underline hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"quiz link\" href=\"/quiz\">\n                Quiz\n            </a>\n            <span class=\"ml-auto hidden items-center text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)] sm:flex\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"subject title\">\n                Indian Economic Development\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n    <main data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"main content area\" id=\"top\">\n        <section class=\"top-shell pb-7 pt-8 sm:pb-8 sm:pt-10\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"introduction section\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-8 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-start max-sm:gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"intro row\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-[760px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"intro text block\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"metadata text\">\n                        Class XI\n                        <span class=\"px-1.5 text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"separator\">\n                            ·\n                        </span>\n                        2025 Economics\n                        <span class=\"px-1.5 text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"separator\">\n                            ·\n                        </span>\n                        India\n                    </p>\n                    <h1 class=\"mb-2 font-[var(--serif)] text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-.035em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero title\">\n                        Understand the forces shaping India's economy.\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"mb-0 max-w-[650px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hero description\">\n                        A guided, visual presentation on India's economic history, its major sectors, and the choices behind development.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"shrink-0 pb-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--brand)] underline decoration-[var(--accent)] decoration-2 underline-offset-4 max-sm:hidden\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"go to presentation link\" href=\"#presentation\">\n                    Go to the presentation\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"down arrow icon\">\n                        ↓\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"lesson-mobile-meta mb-0 mt-4 text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile breadcrumb trail\">\n                Home\n                <span class=\"px-1 text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"separator\">\n                    /\n                </span>\n                Class XI\n                <span class=\"px-1 text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"separator\">\n                    /\n                </span>\n                Economics\n            </p>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"presentation-heading\" class=\"top-shell pb-12\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"presentation section\" id=\"presentation\">\n            <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-5 max-sm:items-start\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"presentation header row\">\n                <h2 class=\"m-0 font-[var(--serif)] text-[23px] leading-tight tracking-[-.02em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"presentation heading\" id=\"presentation-heading\">\n                    Indian Economic Development\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"m-0 whitespace-nowrap text-[14px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"slide counter text\">\n                    Slide\n                    <span class=\"text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"current slide number\">\n                        01\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"px-1 text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"separator\">\n                        /\n                    </span>\n                    19\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lesson-stage\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"presentation stage container\">\n                <div class=\"stage-art\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stage art container\">\n                    <img alt=\"Fields, a factory, renewable energy, transport, and a growing Indian city\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"stage image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/assets/cover-india-economy.svg\"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stage-copy\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"stage copy section\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[var(--accent-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"stage category label\">\n                        Class XI Economics · 2025\n                    </p>\n                    <h3 class=\"mb-4 font-[var(--serif)] text-[clamp(2.25rem,4vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-.025em] text-[#f7f9f6]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"slide title\">\n                        Indian Economic Development\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"m-0 max-w-[400px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-[#d5e0e1]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"slide description\">\n                        A guided presentation for Class XI Economics · 2025\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[#46606d] pt-5 text-[13px] text-[#c8d6d8]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"slide footer info\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center border border-[#607c87] text-[var(--accent-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"total slide count badge\">\n                            19\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"slide info text\">\n                            slides\n                            <span class=\"px-1 text-[var(--accent-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"separator\">\n                                ·\n                            </span>\n                            Designed for classroom discussion\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex min-h-[70px] items-center justify-between gap-5 border-b border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-4 sm:px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"slide navigation bar\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Previous slide, unavailable on first slide\" class=\"flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--canvas)] px-4 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"previous slide button\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                        ←\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"button label\">\n                        Previous\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-3 border border-[var(--brand)] bg-[var(--brand)] px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"next slide button\" type=\"button\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"button label\">\n                        Next\n                    </span>\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                        →\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-b border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"slide navigation grid container\">\n                <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"grid header row\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"grid title\">\n                        Jump to a slide\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div aria-label=\"Choose a slide\" class=\"indicator-grid\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"slide indicator grid\">\n                    <button aria-current=\"step\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1: Indian Economic Development\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--brand)] bg-[var(--brand)] text-[13px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        01\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        02\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        03\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 4\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-4\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        04\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 5\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-5\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        05\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 6\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-6\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        06\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 7\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-7\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        07\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 8\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-8\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        08\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 9\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-9\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        09\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 10\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-10\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        10\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 11\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-11\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        11\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 12\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-12\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        12\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 13\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-13\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        13\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 14\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-14\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        14\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 15\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-15\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        15\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 16\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-16\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        16\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 17\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-17\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        17\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 18\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-18\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        18\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Go to slide 19\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-19\" data-name=\"slide indicator button\">\n                        19\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--rule)] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"presentation toolbar\">\n                <div aria-label=\"Presentation tools\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"presentation tool buttons container\">\n                    <button class=\"min-h-[42px] border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--ink)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"fullscreen button\" type=\"button\">\n                        Fullscreen\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"min-h-[42px] border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--ink)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"print button\" type=\"button\">\n                        Print\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"min-h-[42px] border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--ink)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-1-3\" data-name=\"save slide button\" type=\"button\">\n                        Save current slide\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"min-h-[42px] border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--ink)] hover:border-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-1-4\" data-name=\"share button\" type=\"button\">\n                        Share\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"m-0 text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"helper instruction text\">\n                    Use ← and → to move through the lesson. Press\n                    <kbd class=\"border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"shortcut key label\">\n                        F\n                    </kbd>\n                    for fullscreen.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <p aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"m-0 min-h-[20px] pt-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--good)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-6\" data-name=\"polite status indicator\" data-reason=\"status message text updated by script\" role=\"status\">\n            </p>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"course-heading\" class=\"border-y border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"course map section\" id=\"course-map\">\n            <div class=\"top-shell grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] md:gap-16 md:py-16\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"course map container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"course map intro\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-4 max-w-[430px] font-[var(--serif)] text-[clamp(2rem,3vw,2.8rem)] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-.03em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"course map heading\" id=\"course-heading\">\n                        From economic history to today's questions.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mb-6 max-w-[420px] text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"course map description\">\n                        The lesson connects India's past policy choices with the way people work, produce, trade, and live today.\n                    </p>\n                    <a class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--brand)] underline decoration-[var(--accent)] decoration-2 underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"start link\" href=\"#presentation\">\n                        Start with slide one\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                            ↗\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <ol class=\"lesson-unit-list m-0 list-none p-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"lesson unit list\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"lesson unit item\">\n                        <span class=\"pt-0.5 text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"unit number\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"unit details\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[20px] leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"unit title\">\n                                History and reform\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"unit description\">\n                                Colonial legacies, planned development, and the reforms that began in 1991.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"lesson unit item\">\n                        <span class=\"pt-0.5 text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"unit number\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"unit details\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[20px] leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"unit title\">\n                                Three connected sectors\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"unit description\">\n                                Agriculture, industry, and services, and how each depends on the others.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"lesson unit item\">\n                        <span class=\"pt-0.5 text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"unit number\">\n                            03\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"unit details\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[20px] leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"unit title\">\n                                Development in practice\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"unit description\">\n                                Rural and urban change, public programmes, and sustainable growth.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"lesson unit item\">\n                        <span class=\"pt-0.5 text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"unit number\">\n                            04\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"unit details\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[20px] leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"unit title\">\n                                India and the wider world\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"unit description\">\n                                Trade, investment, and the country's place in the global economy.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-label=\"Study and practice\" class=\"top-shell py-11 sm:py-14\" data-kid=\"1-3-4\" data-name=\"resources section\">\n            <h2 class=\"mb-6 font-[var(--serif)] text-[26px] tracking-[-.025em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"resources heading\">\n                Keep learning\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"lesson-resources\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"resources container\">\n                <a class=\"lesson-resource no-underline text-[var(--ink)] hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"study guide resource link\" href=\"/study-guide\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"resource link body\">\n                        <strong class=\"block font-[var(--serif)] text-[21px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"resource title\">\n                            Study guide\n                        </strong>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block max-w-[450px] text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"resource description\">\n                            Nine chapter explanations, diagrams, marks and answer guidance.\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-[20px] text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"external link icon\">\n                        ↗\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"lesson-resource no-underline text-[var(--ink)] hover:text-[var(--brand)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"quiz resource link\" href=\"/quiz\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"resource link body\">\n                        <strong class=\"block font-[var(--serif)] text-[21px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"resource title\">\n                            Quiz\n                        </strong>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block max-w-[450px] text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"resource description\">\n                            Check your understanding with multiple-choice and written questions.\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-1 text-[20px] text-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"external link icon\">\n                        ↗\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"border-t border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface-2)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5\" data-name=\"about section\" id=\"about\">\n            <div class=\"top-shell grid gap-6 py-9 md:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] md:gap-16 md:py-11\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"about container\">\n                <h2 class=\"mb-0 font-[var(--serif)] text-[25px] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-.02em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"about heading\">\n                    One lesson, ready to teach and explore.\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"max-w-[760px] text-[14px] leading-[1.65] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"about description text\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"paragraph\">\n                        Move at the pace of the room. Use the slide controls, select a marker to revisit a topic, or open the presentation in fullscreen. The content is organized to support explanation and discussion.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"m-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"paragraph\">\n                        Print the presentation or save the current slide for class notes. Keyboard navigation and touch gestures are also available.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n        <div class=\"top-shell flex min-h-[80px] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"footer content row\">\n            <a class=\"font-[var(--serif)] text-[19px] font-semibold text-[var(--brand)] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand link\" href=\"#top\">\n                ZeeTeach\n            </a>\n            <p class=\"m-0 text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"copyright text\">\n                Indian Economic Development · Class XI · 2025\n            </p>\n            <nav aria-label=\"Legal information\" class=\"flex gap-5 text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"legal navigation\">\n                <a data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"terms link\" href=\"/terms\">\n                    Terms of Service\n                </a>\n                <a data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"privacy link\" href=\"/privacy\">\n                    Privacy Policy\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-06T07:35:11.961391+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-06T07:38:47.306786+00:00",
