d=\"1-3-2-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"deck-actions mt-3 grid grid-cols-[minmax(245px,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)] items-end gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"deck control actions section\">\n                    <label class=\"block text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"slide jump selector label\">\n                        Jump to a slide\n                        <span class=\"relative mt-1.5 block\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"selector wrapper\">\n                            <select class=\"min-h-11 w-full appearance-none rounded-lg border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--paper-raised)] px-3.5 pr-10 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--ink)] outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--clay)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"jump to slide dropdown\">\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"dropdown option\" selected=\"\">\n                                    01 — Indian Economic Development\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    02 — Course Overview\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    03 — What Do We Mean by Development?\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    04 — Historical Economic Context\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-5\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    05 — Economic Reforms Since 1991\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-6\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    06 — Three Connected Economic Sectors\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-7\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    07 — Agriculture and Rural Livelihoods\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-8\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    08 — Industry and Production\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-9\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    09 — Services and New Forms of Work\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-10\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    10 — Development Challenges\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-11\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    11 — Public Programmes and Initiatives\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-12\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    12 — Rural Development\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-13\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    13 — Urban Development\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-14\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    14 — Sustainable Development\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-15\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    15 — India and the Global Economy\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-16\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    16 — Learning Outcomes\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-17\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    17 — Assessment and Discussion\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-18\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    18 — Learning Resources\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-1-19\" data-name=\"dropdown option\">\n                                    19 — Questions and Discussion\n                                </option>\n                            </select>\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-chevron-down pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[17px] text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"dropdown arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"deck-tools flex min-h-11 flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"deck utility tools container\">\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--forest)] hover:bg-[var(--paper-deep)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"fullscreen button\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrows-maximize text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"fullscreen icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Fullscreen\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted)] hover:bg-[var(--paper-deep)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"print button\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-printer text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"print icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Print\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted)] hover:bg-[var(--paper-deep)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"save slide button\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-download text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"save icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Save current slide\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--muted)] hover:bg-[var(--paper-deep)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"share button\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-share-3 text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"share icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Share\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mb-0 mt-2 text-right text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)] max-[680px]:text-left\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-4\" data-name=\"deck helper text\">\n                    Use the arrow keys to move through the lesson. Press\n                    <kbd class=\"rounded border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--paper-raised)] px-1.5 py-0.5 font-[var(--sans)] text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"fullscreen keyboard shortcut key\">\n                        F\n                    </kbd>\n                    for fullscreen.\n                </p>\n            </section>\n            <aside aria-labelledby=\"outline-title\" class=\"lesson-aside border-l border-[var(--rule)] pl-7\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"course outline aside\">\n                <h2 class=\"mb-2 font-[var(--serif)] text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-[-0.035em] text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"outline section heading\" id=\"outline-title\">\n                    Course outline\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mb-6 max-w-[27ch] text-[14px] leading-[1.55] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"outline description text\">\n                    From economic history to today’s questions. The lesson connects India’s past policy choices with how people work, produce, trade, and live today.\n                </p>\n                <ol class=\"course-route m-0 list-none space-y-0 pl-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"outline progress route list\">\n                    <li class=\"relative flex gap-4 pb-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"first route step\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-[1] grid h-[37px] w-[37px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--clay)] bg-[var(--paper)] font-[var(--serif)] text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--clay)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"pt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[1.12rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                History and reform\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.48] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Colonial legacies, planned development, and the reforms that began in 1991.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"relative flex gap-4 pb-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"second route step\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-[1] grid h-[37px] w-[37px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--paper)] font-[var(--serif)] text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"pt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[1.12rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                Three connected sectors\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.48] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Agriculture, industry, and services, and how each depends on the others.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"relative flex gap-4 pb-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"third route step\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-[1] grid h-[37px] w-[37px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--paper)] font-[var(--serif)] text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">\n                            03\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"pt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[1.12rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                Development in practice\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.48] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Rural and urban change, public programmes, and sustainable growth.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"relative flex gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"fourth route step\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-[1] grid h-[37px] w-[37px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--paper)] font-[var(--serif)] text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"step number badge\">\n                            04\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"pt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"step content container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"mb-1 font-[var(--serif)] text-[1.12rem] font-semibold leading-tight text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                India and the wider world\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 text-[13px] leading-[1.48] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                Trade, investment, and the country’s place in the global economy.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n                <div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-[var(--rule)] pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"outline alternate format links container\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"alternative format prompt text\">\n                        Continue with the same chapter in another format.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"alternate links row\">\n                        <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 text-[var(--forest)] underline decoration-[var(--rule)] underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"study guide link\" href=\"/study-guide\">\n                            Study guide\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"external link arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 text-[var(--forest)] underline decoration-[var(--rule)] underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-[var(--forest)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"quiz link\" href=\"/quiz\">\n                            Quiz\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"external link arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--paper-deep)]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1360px] items-center justif